abstract: "A reusable analysis framework and writing style tool based on Warren Buffett's public methodology, including the Circle of Competence, Margin of Safety, Mr. Market, Economic Moat (five types), Owner Earnings, Capital Allocation (five pathways), Intrinsic Value, Long-term Compounding, Management Quality (three dimensions), Concentration, Inflation Defense, and 20-Slot Punch Card discipline. Designed to assist in corporate quality assessment, moat analysis, intrinsic value estimation, management evaluation, and capital allocation judgment. This skill provides a thinking framework and writing style calibration, and does NOT claim to represent Warren Buffett personally or his unpublished views."
